sequenceDiagram
    participant Tab as React Tab
    participant Hook as SSE Hook
    participant Guard as readinessGuard
    participant API as Express Controller

    Tab->>Hook: Mount & EventSource(/events)
    alt Engine initializing
        Guard-->>Tab: 503 SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE
    else Engine ready
        Hook->>API: Open SSE Stream
        API-->>Hook: event: batch / inventory (2s)
        opt Network/SSE errors >= 2
            Hook->>API: Fallback 2s Polling (Abort 10s)
            API-->>Hook: 200 OK JSON
        end
    end